        <UserObject label="(azureml_py38) azureuser@option3-compute:~/cloudfiles/code/Users/nehali$ ip add&lt;br&gt;1: lo: &amp;lt;LOOPBACK,UP,LOWER_UP&amp;gt; mtu 65536 qdisc noqueue state UNKNOWN group default qlen 1000&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; link/loopback 00:00:00:00:00:00 brd 00:00:00:00:00:00&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; inet 127.0.0.1/8 scope host lo&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; inet6 ::1/128 scope host&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever&lt;br&gt;2: eth0: &amp;lt;BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP&amp;gt; mtu 1500 qdisc mq state UP group default qlen 1000&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; link/ether 60:45:bd:d7:af:58 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; inet 10.2.0.5/29 brd 10.2.0.7 scope global eth0&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; inet6 fe80::6245:bdff:fed7:af58/64 scope link&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever&lt;br&gt;3: docker0: &amp;lt;NO-CARRIER,BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP&amp;gt; mtu 1500 qdisc noqueue state DOWN group default&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; link/ether 02:42:36:ba:5b:e9 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; inet 172.17.0.1/16 brd 172.17.255.255 scope global docker0&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever&lt;br&gt;(azureml_py38) azureuser@option3-compute:~/cloudfiles/code/Users/nehali$ curl ifconfig.me&lt;br&gt;48.216.130.101(azureml_py38) azureuser@option3-compute:~/cloudfiles/code/Users/nehali$" link="(azureml_py38) azureuser@option3-compute:~/cloudfiles/code/Users/nehali$ ip add&#xa;1: lo: &lt;LOOPBACK,UP,LOWER_UP&gt; mtu 65536 qdisc noqueue state UNKNOWN group default qlen 1000&#xa;    link/loopback 00:00:00:00:00:00 brd 00:00:00:00